# Author: Muhammad Mohsin Khan
# Created: 9.10.2026
# ==========================================================
# CalculiX GraphiX (cgx) FBD script
# Section 5.1 - Cantilever beam from the CalculiX CrunchiX manual
# Unit system: mm, s, N, tonne
#
# Geometry: 1000 x 1000 x 8000 mm; beam axis is global Z.
# Fixed end: z = 0 mm. Free/load end: z = 8000 mm.
# Reference end force for the CCX input deck: 9.0E6 N.
#
# Mesh: linear hexahedra (HE8/C3D20R), 10 x 10 x 80 divisions.
# Expected nominal mesh: 8000 brick elements.
#
# Run from a writable working directory:
#   cgx -b cantilever_linearstatic.fbd
#
# The script exports the mesh and named node sets. Depending on the CGX
# version, the Abaqus-format mesh/set files are written using the set names.
# ==========================================================

# Geometry dimensions [mm]
valu L 8000
valu B 1000
valu H 1000

# Quadratic line divisions:
# two divisions per quadratic element
valu NX 4
valu NY 4
valu NZ 16

# Coordinate selection tolerance [mm]
valu TOL 0.01

# Midpoint coordinates for the nine-node load grid
valu BX / B 2
valu HY / H 2

# Create the base line along global X
pnt p1 0 0 0
pnt p2 B 0 0
line lbase p1 p2
div lbase NX
seta base_line l lbase

# Sweep along global Y to create the square cross-section
swep base_line cross_section tra 0 H 0 NY
seta cross_section_surfaces s A001

# Sweep along global Z to create the beam
swep cross_section_surfaces beam tra 0 0 L NZ

# Generate quadratic reduced-integration brick elements
elty all he20r
mesh all

# Create a node-only set for coordinate-based selection
seta ALL_NODES n all

# Select every node on the fixed and free end faces
enq ALL_NODES FIX rec _ _ 0 TOL a
enq ALL_NODES END_FACE rec _ _ L TOL a

# Select the nine corner-grid nodes at the free end.
# Do not include the additional midside nodes in LOADEND.
enq END_FACE LD01 rec 0 0 L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD02 rec BX 0 L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD03 rec B 0 L TOL a

enq END_FACE LD04 rec 0 HY L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD05 rec BX HY L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD06 rec B HY L TOL a

enq END_FACE LD07 rec 0 H L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD08 rec BX H L TOL a
enq END_FACE LD09 rec B H L TOL a

# Combine the nine selected nodes into LOADEND
seta LOADEND n LD01 LD02 LD03
seta LOADEND n LD04 LD05 LD06
seta LOADEND n LD07 LD08 LD09

# Export mesh and node sets
send all abq
send FIX abq nam
send LOADEND abq nam
send ALL_NODES abq nam
